Package: dbparser.mcp
Title: Model Context Protocol Server for 'dbparser'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(
    person("Mohammed", "Ali", email = "mohammed.ali@interstellar-egypt.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Interstellar", role = c("cph", "fnd"),
           comment = c("Interstellar for Consultation Services",
                       URL = "https://interstellar-egypt.com")))
Description: A local, read-only 'Model Context Protocol' ('MCP') server for
    the 'dbparser' package. It lets 'MCP' clients such as 'Claude Code' and
    'Claude Desktop' parse the user's own local drug and gene database files,
    describe the parsed tables and read capped rows from them, always with the
    source's release, licence and attribution. It runs over standard input and
    output only, reads only local files and never downloads data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
